下終不以私亂公。語曰：『雖有親父，安知其不爲虎？雖有親兄，安知其不爲狼？』今大王列在諸侯，悅一邪臣浮説，犯上禁，橈明法。天子以太后故，不忍致法於王。太后日夜涕泣，幸大王自改，而大王終不覺寤。有如太后宮車即晏駕，大王尚誰攀乎？」語未卒，孝王泣數行下，謝安國曰：「吾今出詭、勝。」詭、勝自殺。漢使還報，梁事皆得釋，安國之力也。於是景帝、太后益重安國。孝王卒，共王即位，安國坐法失官，居家。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"公孫詭","kind":"person","person_id":"v4l_7vt_hsb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"羊勝","kind":"person","person_id":"ezo_6oj_gne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"l5d_ywu_jfb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"40v_x1i_esm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4kp_bwq_ayu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"詭","kind":"person","person_id":"v4l_7vt_hsb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"ezo_6oj_gne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"詭","kind":"person","person_id":"v4l_7vt_hsb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"ezo_6oj_gne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m005-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"詭","kind":"person","person_id":"v4l_7vt_hsb","status":"contextual_p